<title>USA: SBC declines comment on AT&amp;T report.</title>
<headline>SBC declines comment on AT&amp;T report.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Communications Inc declined to comment on a report that it is in substantive merger talks with AT&amp;T Corp on a deal valued at more than $50 billion.</p>
<p>&quot;We have no comment,&quot; SBC spokesman Larry Solomon said when asked about the report of merger talks between the two telecommunication giants, which appeared in Tuesday's Wall Street Journal.</p>
<p>SBC Communications only recently closed its acquisition of another Baby Bell company, Pacific Telesis Group.</p>
<p>((Eric Auchard, New York newsdesk, 212-859-1736))</p>
